Perform a system health check for the Hermes Agent admin profile.

Check:
1. Gateway status (PID, uptime, connected platforms)
2. Disk space on /root and /tmp
3. Memory/CPU usage of Hermes processes
4. Cron job status (list all, check for failures)
5. Config validation (profiles exist, configs valid)
6. Any error logs in ~/.hermes/logs/

Output: Concise technical summary. Flag any issues needing attention. Deliver to Telegram DM.